prime","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesLinks.lean#L37-L42","doc":"For `gcd(n + 1, p) = 1` no middle-weight state is fixed by `rot^p`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.fixCount_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.RossoJonesGeneral.fixCount_zero","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/RossoJonesLinks.lean#L34-L35","signatureChunk":0}]}